# Implements: WC-134 R005; identity-boundary.md Section 6.3.
# constitutional_basis: C-023, C-026, C-059, C-063
# Use the local Compose Business Platform address and fresh owning-account token.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@accessToken = replace-with-fresh-owning-account-access-token
@linkId = replace-with-returned-link-id
@relationshipId = replace-with-currently-authorized-relationship-id
@ineligibleRelationshipId = replace-with-discovered-or-terminated-relationship-id

### Start with the server-selected verified registration proof
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/identity/account-links
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Explicitly approve; send the returned instruction from the verified WhatsApp number
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/identity/account-links/{{linkId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002

### Check status without granting a session or relationship
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/identity/account-links/{{linkId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel before signed confirmation; repeat this key only to replay this cancellation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/identity/account-links/{{linkId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003

### Explicitly grant the linked WhatsApp identity access to one relationship
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employment/relationships/{{relationshipId}}/workspace/channels/whatsapp
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identityAccountLinkId": "{{linkId}}",
  "consentToRelationshipChannel": true
}

### A discovered or terminated relationship is denied with 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employment/relationships/{{ineligibleRelationshipId}}/workspace/channels/whatsapp
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identityAccountLinkId": "{{linkId}}",
  "consentToRelationshipChannel": true
}

### Missing or inaccessible challenges disclose no other account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/identity/account-links/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
